        "TileImage": "$($repository feebde99-6cbf-408c-8b57-a98c3d6e3099).Image",
        "Description": "The target is Daniel Duhamel, a talent agent with a damning client history. He is known for attending fasion shows, convincing young models to go freelance with him as their agent, before forcing them to overwork through mental abuse. Many of his clients have attempted suicide, and a number, like our client&apos;s son, succeded.\rDuhamel is on the guest list for the Sanguine Fashion show in Paris, which gives a perfect opportunity to engage.\rOur client wants Duhamel to never ruin another young life.",
